OL,3,GNEWSAMy 999 call foiled RAF Fairford
OL,4,Aplot, farmer tells BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FA farmer who told the BBC her 999 call
OL,7,F"foiled" a suspected terror plot said
OL,8,Fpolice and security services "dropped
OL,9,Fthe ball" in their handling of the
OL,10,Fincident.
OL,12,FShe said she called police just after
OL,13,F01:30 BST on Sunday after seeing three
OL,14,Fvans parked in a "weird formation" near
OL,15,FRAF Fairford in Gloucestershire. There
OL,16,Fwas "a large group of hooded and masked
OL,17,Fmen" near the vans who started to
OL,18,F"panic" when they saw her, she said.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
