OL,3,GNEWSAMy 999 call foiled RAF Fairford
OL,4,Aplot, farmer tells BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive men, all UK nationals from London
OL,7,Fin their early to mid 20s, were
OL,8,Farrested on suspicion of preparing a
OL,9,Fterrorist act and have been released on
OL,10,Fpolice bail.
OL,12,FDefence Secretary Wes Streeting said he
OL,13,Fwas grateful to the resident but that
OL,14,Fshe had only "a partial picture".
